               &lt;p&gt;Sultan Sschool District: We will be on a 2-hour delay schedule for tomorrow, Thursday, December 11th, 2025. There will be no AM out of District transportation.&amp;nbsp; We will provide an update at 7:30 AM tomorrow.&lt;/p&gt;
